From: ImpulseROM <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Alias Activity.semSetDisablePreviewScreenshots for the stock Note10+ camera

One UI 8.5 renamed Activity.semSetDisablePreviewScreenshots(Z) to setDisablePreviewScreenshots(Z).
The stock Note10+ camera (12.0.01.50) still calls the sem name from CameraWindowManager and dies with
NoSuchMethodError at start. Keep the old name as a thin forwarder. This adds one method, so it is listed
in scripts/internal/dex_allowed_additions/system/system/framework/framework.jar.tsv (logical dex 1).
---

--- a/smali/android/app/Activity.smali
+++ b/smali/android/app/Activity.smali
@@ -12787,6 +12787,14 @@
     return-void
 .end method
 
+.method public semSetDisablePreviewScreenshots(Z)V
+    .locals 0
+
+    invoke-virtual {p0, p1}, Landroid/app/Activity;->setDisablePreviewScreenshots(Z)V
+
+    return-void
+.end method
+
 .method public whitelist setEnterSharedElementCallback(Landroid/app/SharedElementCallback;)V
     .locals 0
 
